    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I also noticed that some of the shards are much more fragmented than others in the same layer, almost like they were crushed or scattered unevenly. Is there a way to tell if that kind of fragmentation is due to the original firing process or just post-depositional damage?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
